  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Lombok Clinic Ambulance for 2000+ Patients</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Bumi Sehat Lombok Clinic, which serves 2000+ patients each year, urgently needs an ambulance. This will allow the clinic to safely transport patients to the nearest hospital inside a medically-outfitted vehicle. Medical staff can safely deliver urgent, emergency medical treatment on route (including midwifery and birth care) instead of delaying care until reaching the hospital, which can negatively affect patient outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
